### Every scored La Liga round (oldest first)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/1/mvps?season=2026

### Latest round from each featured competition
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/mvps/latest?season=2026

### Resolve the latest club season
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/mvps/latest

### Existing competition without data: 200, items []
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/1/mvps?season=1900

### Unknown competition: 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/999999/mvps?season=2026

### Invalid season: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/mvps/latest?season=invalid

### Inconsistent published scope rules: 409 (requires inconsistent test data)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tournaments/1/mvps?season=2025
